<title>USA: Competitive muni sales to total $36 mln Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Competitive muni sales to total $36 mln Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive municipal bond sales are expected to total $36 million in nine offerings for Tuesday, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest is a $7.8 million South Brunswick Township, N.J., general obligation issue set for 1100 EDT. --U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
